546
00:31:39,540 --> 00:31:40,714
Red Flag Number One:

547
00:31:40,714 --> 00:31:45,000
Demands for total isolation from your
established social support network.

548
00:31:46,020 --> 00:31:47,429
Any organization, movement,

549
00:31:47,429 --> 00:31:51,084
or relationship that requires you
