553
00:32:02,340 --> 00:32:03,544
Red Flag Number Two:

554
00:32:03,544 --> 00:32:07,760
Financial usurpation and the
confiscation of personal autonomy assets.

555
00:32:08,680 --> 00:32:12,725
Exercise extreme vigilance whenever a
